"So... I want to be strong. And I already know what it takes to be strong."
{CREATECG "アイコン使用画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "5" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">, if I can keep my promise to you, I'm sure I'll be strong. 
{PAUSE ""}
No, I'll definitely be strong."
{CREATECG "アイコン使用画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "4" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花目閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"You told me I'd be okay, and so did <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>. The two people who've watched me all this time told me that."
{CREATECG "アイコン使用画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "3" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
"So... 
