{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
if it's you and <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> saying it, I can believe it. 
{PAUSE ""}
