{CREATECG "アイコン使用画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "2" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
"Because the only one who understands the me of right now is <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">."
